WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.254
Robot watched Hope search her room.

2
00:00:07.255 --> 00:00:11.477
"Where's my favorite comic?" she said.

3
00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:15.134
"We'll find it," Mom said.

4
00:00:15.135 --> 00:00:20.578
"I'll look downstairs."

5
00:00:20.579 --> 00:00:23.680
Hope kept looking.

6
00:00:23.681 --> 00:00:25.908
Hope bit her lip.

7
00:00:25.909 --> 00:00:28.387
"I hope I didn't lose it!"

8
00:00:28.388 --> 00:00:30.929
"Hmm," Robot thought.

9
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.630
"If she can't find the comic, she'll bring me!"

10
00:00:34.631 --> 00:00:38.592
Robot tried to look cool enough for show-and-tell.

11
00:00:38.593 --> 00:00:43.371
He snapped his claw and flashed his lights.

12
00:00:43.372 --> 00:00:49.917
But Hope wasn't looking at him.

13
00:00:49.918 --> 00:00:53.481
"Any luck down there, Mom?" Hope called.

14
00:00:53.482 --> 00:00:58.314
"Not so far," Mom said.

15
00:00:58.315 --> 00:01:03.256
Hope's eyes filled with tears.

16
00:01:03.257 --> 00:01:05.329
"Maybe I left it in the car."

17
00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.475
She rushed out of the room.

18
00:01:09.476 --> 00:01:14.373
Robot snapped his claw.

19
00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:18.238
"Why won't she notice me?" he said.

20
00:01:18.239 --> 00:01:21.383
Just then he saw the comic!

21
00:01:21.384 --> 00:01:24.680
It was stuck behind the bookshelf!

22
00:01:24.681 --> 00:01:26.914
Robot froze.

23
00:01:26.915 --> 00:01:30.489
"Hope didn't see the comic," he thought.

24
00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.055
"I could get it . . .

25
00:01:32.056 --> 00:01:36.122
But then Hope won't take me to show-and-tell."

26
00:01:36.123 --> 00:01:38.937
Robot thought and thought.

27
00:01:38.938 --> 00:01:42.927
He wanted to go to show-and-tell very badly.

28
00:01:42.928 --> 00:01:46.460
He could show everyone he was a cool toy.

29
00:01:46.461 --> 00:01:49.531
But Hope looked so sad.

30
00:01:49.532 --> 00:02:00.962
"Fine!" Robot huffed. "I'll get the comic."

31
00:02:00.963 --> 00:02:03.564
Robot reached with his claw.

32
00:02:03.565 --> 00:02:06.338
He tried to pull the comic out.

33
00:02:06.339 --> 00:02:10.408
"Oh no! Now I'm stuck!" he thought.

34
00:02:10.409 --> 00:02:13.443
He beeped and tried to get free.

35
00:02:13.444 --> 00:02:18.049
Hope came running back in.

36
00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:21.355
"Robot! How did you get stuck there?"

37
00:02:21.356 --> 00:02:24.844
Hope bent down and grabbed Robot.

38
00:02:24.845 --> 00:02:28.068
Suddenly she gasped.

39
00:02:28.069 --> 00:02:31.746
"Mom! I found the comic!"

40
00:02:31.747 --> 00:02:37.236
Mom appeared. "Oh good!"

41
00:02:37.237 --> 00:02:41.542
Hope stared at Robot. "It was almost as if . . .

42
00:02:41.543 --> 00:02:44.383
Robot was helping me."

43
00:02:44.384 --> 00:02:53.916
Mom laughed. "Wouldn't that be nice!"

